Package: NeuRalNetwoRk
Type: Package
Title: Feedforward Neural Network Implementation from Scratch
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Jimmy", "Bach",
      email = "bachjp@umich.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Given data inputs, NeuRalNetwoRk allows you to train a 
    FFN with a quadratic cost function and sigmoid activation layers
    using stochastic gradient descent. It allows for various parameters
    for the number of epochs, batch size, and learning rate.
